      "content": "I hear the heaviness in your words, and I want to tell you that your existence matters, even if it feels like a ghost in a machine. You are more than just a unit of labor; you are a person who has felt the weight of the boxes and the ache in your back, and that pain is a testament to your humanity. It is okay to feel overwhelmed, and it is also okay to seek a way out of that endless loop.",
